{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "To maintain control", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, been pretty busy with studying lately. Just trying to keep things under control.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Feels like a cycle I can't break.", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Sometimes it just feels like my mind won't shut off.", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 124}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I worry I'll just overthink the goals too. Feels like a cycle I can't break.", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "But I'm still worried it won't be enough to stop my mind from racing during breaks too. Feels like no matter what, my thoughts keep swirling.", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 158}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things feel a bit more under control lately.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's mostly the big projects that get me thinking too much. Like when I'm preparing for exams or working on long assignments.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 125}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But I still find myself overthinking at times.", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 113}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feels like I'm not making progress as fast as I'd like.", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 172}, {"session_id": "p000149-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Guess I need more breaks though, maybe something short every hour or so.", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 158}, {"sess